<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Marmagao port on February 6:</p>
<p> Commodity		Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Iron Ore	    61,049 (LDD)  2,851    Hermes	   04/02</p>
<p>Alumina	     20,621 (LDD)    379    Jeon Jin	 29/01</p>
<p>Coke		     756 (ULD) 10,244    Asean Pioneer  05/02</p>
<p>M.Spirit	     2,000 (ULD)  3,000    Jag Prakash    06/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co,Goa)</p>
